                                    ቃሌን፡ ግን፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ይፍታቹሕ፡ አሜን፡፡
                                    <note>The colophon serves as an acquisiotion note, supplication and donation note. It states that <persName role="donor" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15283SardaAragawi"><roleName type="title">ʾAbbā</roleName> Śarḍa ʾAragāwi</persName> 
                                       bought the manuscript with his own money and donated it to the <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/INS0105DD">Dabra Dāmmo ʾAbuna ʾAragāwi</placeName> monastery. The largest part of the note is rhymed. The final words of the note are in Amharic.
                                       It is written by <ref target="#h2"/> though with a thinner pen.</note>
                                 </colophon>
